","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":404,"digest":"sha256:f758fbd0b545c802e74e5338d0c7a67eb755ccf6ac6002d03e626dc2a75ee1f1","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-17T10:03:24Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T10:03:24Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ysya/lunport/releases/download/v1.2.0/Lunport_universal.app.tar.gz.sig"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ysya/lunport/tarball/v1.2.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ysya/lunport/zipball/v1.2.0","body":"## [1.2.0](https://github.com/ysya/lunport/compare/v1.1.0...v1.2.0) (2026-10-17)\n\nmacOS now uses a fixed project signing identity. When upgrading from an older unsigned build, existing Keychain items may ask for authorization once; choose **Always Allow** to retain that permission across later updates. This is a project certificate, not Apple Developer ID or notarization.\n\nFind **Sync** and **Settings** in the upper-right toolbar, **Import hosts** beside **New host**, and **Rename** in SSH key details.\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **keys:** rename SSH keys from key details ([30f692d](https://github.com/ysya/lunport/commit/30f692d361b2fb13e2a47381765d9761ac240ac9))\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **macos:** preserve Keychain authorization across updates ([d8cc0cc](https://github.com/ysya/lunport/commit/d8cc0cc5505a6b59336c2cc97ae7356159fc2aae))\n* **ui:** reserve the full left column for library navigation ([ee75511](https://github.com/ysya/lunport/commit/ee75511c2cf71a4777830d89a73d4c05577df5f7))"}